<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank says not to lower risk provision.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank says not to lower risk provision.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG said on Thursday it saw no reason to relax the level of risk provisions.</p>
<p>The bank said in its interim report that interest and commission income would continue to develop positively, albeit at a moderate pace, in the final quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
